	(gr_text "1.  FABRICATE PCB FROM GERBER DATA CONTAINED IN ZIP FILE\n2.  CLASS 3 PCB PER IPC-6011\n3.  TYPE 3 PCB PER IPC-6012A WITH AMENDMENT 1\n4.  TYPE 1C ASSEMBLY PER IPC-2222\n5.  MATERIAL REQUIREMENTS\n	- HIGH TEMP. FR4\n	- SEE STACK-UP DETAIL FOR AREA WEIGHT PER SQUARE FOOT\n6.  PINK RING IS NOT PERMITTED\n7.  PLATING IN THROUGH HOLES SHALL BE 0.001 INCH  MINIMUM\n8.  PREPREG LAYERS SHALL BE  2 PLIES MINIMUM\n9.  SOLDER MASK  -GREEN PHOTO- IMAGEABLE SOLDER MASK PER IPC-SM-840C CLASS H\n	SHALL BE APPLIED TO BOTH SIDES OF THE PCB (SMOBC)\n10. FINISH -  ALL EXPOSED COPPER AREAS NOT COVERED WITH SOLDER MASK\n	SHALL BE GOLD PLATED\n11. TOLERANCES:\n	- BOW AND TWIST SHALL NOT EXCEED 0.5%\n	- CONDUCTOR WIDTH AND SPACING SHALL BE WITHIN 0.001 INCH OF GERBER FILE DATA\n	- FINAL PWB THICKNESS SHALL BE AS SHOWN IN STACK-UP DETAIL\n	- SURFACE MOUNT PADS SHALL BE FLAT AND SHALL NOT EXTEND MORE THAN 0.003 INCH ABOVE THE PCB SURFACE\n12.  PLATED THROUGH HOLES:\n	- HOLE SIZES IN DRILL CHART ARE IN MILS AND SPECIFY FINISHED DIAMETERS\n	- LAYER TO LAYER REGISTRATION SHALL BE WITHIN 0.003 INCH\n	- HOLE LOCATION SHALL BE WITHIN 0.004 RADIUS OF TRUE POSITION  (RTP)\n	- ALL HOLES SHALL BE ON FIRST DRILL.  SECOND DRILL IS NOT PERMITTED\n	- TOLERANCE FOR COMPONENT LEAD HOLES IS  +/- 0.003 INCH\n	- TOLERANCE FOR VIA HOLES IS +0.002 / -0.010 INCH\n13. CONTROLLED IMPEDANCE OF 100 OHMS +/- 10% TO BE MATCHED ON  ALL LAYERS(5/5/5 FOR INNER AND 7/5/7 FOR TOP)\n14. FILL ALL VIAS\n15. CROSS SECTION CUT REQUIRED"
		(at 230.39743 115.443 0)
		(layer "F.Fab")
		(uuid "f8f3ec2b-cd9a-408f-99db-0e5440a1a536")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
